Ops Console skills
The text of the Built-in skills in the Ops Console pack is adapted from the sources below. Each skill is rewritten for use
in any Repo and under the console's safety rules.

- code-review, grilling, ship, spec, retro, commit-message and pr are adapted from mattpocock/skills
  (https://github.com/mattpocock/skills), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Matt Pocock. The Summary menu in pr comes from
  Dex Horthy's show-me skill in humanlayer/humanlayer, Apache License 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
- humanizer is condensed from blader/humanizer (https://github.com/blader/humanizer), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2025
  Siqi Chen. Its patterns come from Wikipedia's "Signs of AI writing".
- refactor is original to this repository.

